"," while loading and can be used to disable actions in the list.",[346,347],"component-example",{"name":348},"list-card-basic",[292,350,351,352,355,356,359,360,363,364,368],{},"The ",[302,353,354],{},"PageRequest"," type can be imported from ",[302,357,358],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Ftypes\u002Fpagination","; see ",[296,361,72],{"href":362},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fadvanced\u002Fauto-imports#types",". For the full pattern with query fields, see ",[296,365,367],{"href":366},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[318,370,372],{"id":371},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[292,374,375,378,379,382,383,359,386,390],{},[302,376,377],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[302,380,381],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[302,384,385],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[296,387,389],{"href":388},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[346,392],{"name":393},"list-card-title",[318,395,397],{"id":396},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[292,399,400,403,404,407,408,411],{},[302,401,402],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[302,405,406],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[302,409,410],{},"page-size"," is the number of rows per page, 10 by default.",[346,413],{"name":414},"list-card-footer",[416,417,418,432],"ul",{},[419,420,421,422,424,425,359,428,390],"li",{},"After changing ",[302,423,410],{},", query again from the first page with ",[302,426,427],{},"getPagination(1)",[296,429,431],{"href":430},"#re-querying-the-current-page","Re-querying the current page",[419,433,434,435,438,439,441],{},"When both pagination and the summary are off, the bottom only shows ",[302,436,437],{},"#footer","; without ",[302,440,437],{},", there is no bottom area.",[318,443,445],{"id":444},"loading-and-empty-data","Loa